cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "United States Construction Cost Database (USCCDB)"
abstract: >-
  USCCDB v1.0 holds 2,849,829 rows of construction cost observations from U.S.
  public documents (prevailing wages, wages, indexes, area factors, equipment
  rates, permits and spending, public unit costs and bid prices), one row per
  item, region, point in time and source, each with its evidence URL and
  licence. It uses the same columns as the Japan Construction Cost Database.
